          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma omugo Esiteeri muhara w'Abihairi, na Morodekayi, nubwo baakozire ekihandiiko eky'obusobozi, nibagumya ebbaruha egi eya kabiri eyahandiikirwe hali Pulimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abayudaaya boona bakatwekerwa ebbaruha, omu masaza kikumi omu abiri na musanju ag'obukama bw'Ahaswero negondeza Abayudaaya obusinge n'okugwagwana, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 9:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neegamba eti: “Ebiro ebi ebya Pulimu bisemezibwege ha kasumi kabyo akaatairweho Morodekayi Omuyudaaya n'omugo Esiteeri nkooku baaragiire Abayudaaya, kandi nkooku bbo bonka baayeteeriireho ekiragiro hamu n'abaijukuru baabo ha kigambo ky'okusiiba n'okuteera empamo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.9.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.9.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
